@startuml
!include style.puml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 210

actor User
participant ":EqmManager" as Manager
participant "Help" as Help <<utility>>
participant "System.out" as Output

User -> Manager: executeInput("help list overdue")
activate Manager
note right of Manager
Trim surrounding whitespace and check startup status.
Recognise help with an optional topic.
end note
Manager -> Help: print(topic)
activate Help
note right of Help
Trim the topic and normalise whitespace between words.
Keep exact lowercase command spelling.
end note
alt no topic
Help -> Output: print(compact menu)
else topic is "all"
Help -> Output: print(complete reference)
else exact command topic
Help -> Output: print(command description)
else unknown topic
Help -> Output: print(error and compact menu)
end
Output --> User: requested help or topic error
deactivate Help
Manager --> User: ready for the next command
deactivate Manager
note over Manager, Help
No equipment, loan, bundle or storage handler is called.
No record, next identifier or running flag is changed.
end note
@enduml
